    "message": "Merged to main > Fix livestock breeding out of control in the wild:\r\n- Full bond is now 15min not 5min, reproduction can't happen before (can still lead from 5min like before)\r\n- Curious cows don't bond twice as fast anymore\r\n- If a calf is born in the wild somehow, it will age as soon as it's born, and won't be able to reproduce (eg won't be born bonded like the mom)\r\n- Server cap on livestock population of 300 \"livestock.maxPerSpecies\"\r\n- Command to kill off excess livestock, prioritizing not tame > far from TCs > bad genes / old to avoid hurting farms, \"livestock.cullexcess\"\r\n- Add \"livestock.breedOnlyAtHome\" convar, 0 by default, 1 means livestock can only breed near their top bonded player TC",
